<title>NETHERLANDS: NPM SEES SLIGHTLY HIGHER OPERATING NET.</title>
<headline>NPM SEES SLIGHTLY HIGHER OPERATING NET.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nederlandse Participatie Maatschappij NV on Thursday repeated an earlier forecast of a slightly higher operating result over full-year 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;NPM holds to its earlier forecast that its operating result will be slightly higher,&quot; the venture capital company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
